[{"client_msg_id":"5dc95a62-c23e-47d2-a791-0c22a2305684","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"\u003chttps://go-review.googlesource.com/c/go/+/334809\u003e\n直した。","ts":"1626360951.181400","attachments":[{"fallback":"Gerrit Code Review","id":1,"text":"Gerrit Code Review","blocks":null,"service_name":"go-review.googlesource.com","service_icon":"https://go-review.googlesource.com/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://go-review.googlesource.com/c/go/+/334809","original_url":"https://go-review.googlesource.com/c/go/+/334809"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"ultrafastparrot","count":1,"users":["U06ECBRTJ"]},{"name":"sasumatsu","count":2,"users":["U06ECBRTJ","U01BY3SDBRS"]},{"name":"sokudo","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"58z="}]},{"client_msg_id":"b67fcadf-81b2-4724-97e9-56caffee4536","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"(たぶん僕が書いた奴だ)","ts":"1626360354.180800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WnTX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5e13cc82-ab33-4cee-94d8-c67baceaaa09","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"ウッ、path/filepath.IsAbs の Windows 版で UNC 渡した時が変だ。","ts":"1626360346.180600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gEBSc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d8b2169e-c975-4ed3-b25f-342c342dbac8","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"bradfitz はまぁそうなんだけど、joetsai や davidcrawshaw も tailscale だ。","ts":"1626357130.179500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":4,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0","UKHUVMBJR","UG6DF6W87","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SZx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ee6b2da4-fb8e-4e07-b6a9-b6a78ce4fa42","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"tailscale にいっぱい人が流れてるな。","ts":"1626357075.178900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q=1g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7389cce8-0618-45c4-a395-3a7719e9b3e1","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"細かいところで誤りがあるかもしれないけど、大筋ではそういうことになりそう。","ts":"1626340509.178600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6SM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6fd50a4b-f75e-4a85-a489-eb9e41f715f4","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"となると、やっぱこれは監視してひっ迫しだしたら自分で `runtime.GC` 呼ぶのが安定かもなぁ。","ts":"1626340428.178100","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1626340433.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BKBe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"08f626dc-fe3e-4924-95b4-8946ebeed9c6","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"で上の戦略(自分で監視してgraceful shutdown)をとると何が問題になったかというと、急激にメモリ使用量がスパイクしたときに、回収されずに頻繁に自死するかOOMに殺されるかということが頻発する。","ts":"1626340283.177400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M6/Z4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"437f4820-2b11-44ca-9d86-4f65239d65fc","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"まぁ正確にはcgroupですけどね。","ts":"1626340162.175200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a+ApI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7b22bf26-50fc-435f-a834-096d08c7e2f0","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"Docker とミスマッチすることがあるんですね","ts":"1626340146.174900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wj90"}]},{"client_msg_id":"edb8edaa-d64d-4480-abb6-728c6ea200c9","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"しかしGoはRSSがひっ迫してもGCを起こさない。なぜならアロケーションされたメモリ量が倍になったときにしかかからないから。","ts":"1626340122.174200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":1,"users":["UEA8T80GY"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T4j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6a11d7d5-e08f-4a7c-adf3-cc4ceb9974a8","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"(RSS ってどっちだっけって一瞬なる)","ts":"1626340080.173200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ens"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f6f8e90d-953c-460a-b8ec-dc60bae5b676","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"となるとある種のプログラムはページインされた量=RSS(物理メモリ)を監視して、一定ラインを超えたらgraceful shutdownする必要がある。","ts":"1626340048.172400","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1626340102.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Af1Z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3d2613f4-c4e6-49f2-82fa-02a9c45d5e85","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"で、OOMに殺されるのはgracefulではないので避けたい。","ts":"1626340007.171600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2faU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c931f579-eade-45b2-ad3f-bc71397bdcfd","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"たしかGoのGCは論理アロケーションのタイミング。\n\n一方でDockerとかのOOMはページインで殺してくる。","ts":"1626339986.171200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mMWLC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4ebf05a0-ac12-48c4-80cc-8313d40afc39","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"\u003chttps://blog.twitch.tv/en/2019/04/10/go-memory-ballast-how-i-learnt-to-stop-worrying-and-love-the-heap-26c2462549a2/\u003e","ts":"1626339986.171100","attachments":[{"fallback":"Twitch Blog: Twitch Blog | Go memory ballast: How I learnt to stop worrying and love the heap","id":1,"title":"Twitch Blog | Go memory ballast: How I learnt to stop worrying and love the heap","title_link":"https://blog.twitch.tv/en/2019/04/10/go-memory-ballast-how-i-learnt-to-stop-worrying-and-love-the-heap-26c2462549a2/","text":"Go memory ballast: How I learned to stop worrying and love the heap","image_url":"https://blog.twitch.tv/assets/uploads/c35333bd98b62c707604d38f1c7bcb8d.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"Twitch Blog","service_icon":"https://blog.twitch.tv/assets/favicons/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://blog.twitch.tv/en/2019/04/10/go-memory-ballast-how-i-learnt-to-stop-worrying-and-love-the-heap-26c2462549a2/","original_url":"https://blog.twitch.tv/en/2019/04/10/go-memory-ballast-how-i-learnt-to-stop-worrying-and-love-the-heap-26c2462549a2/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"So4sH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c529e5de-99e2-4e28-a583-8e1a74fe2436","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"そう、そこなのよね。","ts":"1626339943.170000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xKbDU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7c0fd496-f65e-4ded-a915-8d414d8f68c7","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"(そうではないとおもっていた)","ts":"1626339938.169900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=c4P6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0fe838c2-afbb-49a3-ab4f-4bd788f78dce","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"GC のタイミングって実際にページインされた量を基準に決まるんですか?","ts":"1626339912.169300","edited":{"user":"UERCTTT8B","ts":"1626339927.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BrBoI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9c1edb44-1148-417f-8ff9-e80f83b74d59","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"まぁ、大体問題にならないってだけか。","ts":"1626339910.169200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yT2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"39f4e1aa-aae6-416a-ad84-e45f55850232","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"それはおかしい気がするな。","ts":"1626339889.168700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BVa8u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9248f97f-89da-4117-903f-182db01755c1","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"いや物理メモリに確保しておく必要すらないのかな。","ts":"1626339827.168100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1q4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b32c3a09-7a15-47cb-aa97-121d6231467f","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"気持ちはわかるけどあんまやりたくないねぇ。GCの頻度を減らしたいというわけではないんだよな。","ts":"1626339785.167800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z2/ss"}]},{"client_msg_id":"432c831a-5a02-4fef-9914-3c3e0cf210a7","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あらかじめページインしちゃうってことか","ts":"1626339712.167100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+cm4r"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4df0e38d-14ca-46ba-b8b1-35757fb83aac","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"無意味にメモリ確保しておくやつ","ts":"1626339692.166700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"58IV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"22cd05ed-f0fe-4c89-b682-b84f934a8e6c","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"それを利用したテクニックがありますね","ts":"1626339688.166400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MZja"}]},{"client_msg_id":"771121eb-b4f8-417d-b6db-f5c40e8197cf","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"これ、メモリプレッシャーをかけたいときはよろしくないな?","ts":"1626339677.166100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T9H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f0b2ee41-5442-402f-b98d-136e0132f7ff","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"デフォルトは `GOGC=100` だから、メモリ使用量が倍になるたびにGCがかかる。","ts":"1626339651.165700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Xpr8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1f2cc503-eada-4050-aae1-ac3de3403c95","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"GOGC設定すればよいのか\n\n\u0026gt; A collection is triggered when the ratio of freshly allocated data to live data remaining after the previous collection reaches this percentage.\n前回のGC以降に新たに割り当てられたメモリと、前回GC後に割り当てられていたメモリとの割合(パーセンテージ)が指定値を超えてたら実行、なのね。","ts":"1626339609.164900","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1626339621.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OnXhV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"18548e51-cc7f-4352-b732-a45d8790d000","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"GCの実行頻度ってどうきまってんやろう?","ts":"1626339218.163200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ikCyT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2c822d39-b15b-4753-b05b-1ef1591993bf","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"`runtime.GC()` 呼ぶっきゃないかなぁ…","ts":"1626339004.162800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CuW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8c2efb01-0f59-4e47-a171-a84a867a600f","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"GoのGCにmemory pressureというかヒント与える方法ないかしらね…","ts":"1626338942.162500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lTff8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"68E93C34-9469-4C6B-BA58-5D952E564E2C","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/eihigh_re0/status/1415569181169262593?s=21|https://twitter.com/eihigh_re0/status/1415569181169262593?s=21\u003e","ts":"1626332983.161300","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/eihigh_re0|@eihigh_re0\u003e: この画像がgopherくんに見えた\n\nいや思ったよりgopherくんだな？？ \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/E6UcqtnVoAE-J58.jpg\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"えいち/eihigh","author_subname":"@eihigh_re0","author_link":"https://twitter.com/eihigh_re0/status/1415569181169262593","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1159820088544878592/1GM9e-fj_normal.jpg","text":"この画像がgopherくんに見えた\n\nいや思ったよりgopherくんだな？？ \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/E6UcqtnVoAE-J58.jpg\u003e","image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/E6UcqtnVoAE-J58.jpg","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1626332967,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/eihigh_re0/status/1415569181169262593?s=21","original_url":"https://twitter.com/eihigh_re0/status/1415569181169262593?s=21"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"fuita","count":6,"users":["U06BRP8VD","U022T2S7NGL","U01BY3SDBRS","U9S4G0LJW","U06ECBRTJ","UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"t3X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b1493e99-0dde-4b86-a690-9ca40d83f3a7","type":"message","user":"U023Z8L90BG","text":"こういうこと言うと怒られそうですけどヤンキーとか暴走族の方のバイクを連想しますｗ","ts":"1626332771.161100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WAu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3be1474b-1a04-4718-9e9e-6525bcbc4c90","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ステッカーとか冷蔵庫の磁石とか好きだけど、後が大変なので絶対したくない","ts":"1626331132.159300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AJyV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5888ba8f-8f0f-4c8a-9d95-d374b4dd2e43","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"何度見てもステッカーペタペタ文化は理解できない","ts":"1626331077.158700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["U011FTGJ3SN","U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aHE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"257d54d7-07d7-4066-8a17-74c2eaf5ac8c","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/uint256_t/status/1415559675035066368\u003e","ts":"1626330776.157900","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/uint256_t|@uint256_t\u003e: Goと和解した \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/E6UUBaQVgAcdf_9.jpg\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"uint256_t","author_subname":"@uint256_t","author_link":"https://twitter.com/uint256_t/status/1415559675035066368","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1381454623781756930/9GoNLtoQ_normal.png","text":"Goと和解した \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/E6UUBaQVgAcdf_9.jpg\u003e","image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/E6UUBaQVgAcdf_9.jpg","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1626330701,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/uint256_t/status/1415559675035066368","original_url":"https://twitter.com/uint256_t/status/1415559675035066368"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":4,"users":["UKHUVMBJR","U01BY3SDBRS","U8CC7MDCL","U022T2S7NGL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AvU5"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"\u003c@UD1FQV38V\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1626330772.157700","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"317d3a0f-2f41-434b-b5b6-560534934455","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"Java だと、コントローラ、ロジック、サービスと渡ってコードが実行されてて、その間はほぼプロキシ状態のソースとか結構あるけど、Go ってそういうの無いし、大域脱出したいケースあんまないと思う。","ts":"1626330275.156900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruho","count":1,"users":["UKHUVMBJR"]},{"name":"tashikani","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lnPl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"01466fed-4efb-49ce-ad02-92ab88c22a5c","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"catch でなにか処理することはあまりない (あったとしても一番上) なので defer で困らない派","ts":"1626329978.155400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QC8t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9525e310-f131-478c-bd86-40bad3df212e","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"まあ、だからなんだと思う派だけど個人的には","ts":"1626329935.154900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PDLc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5ed9085d-b767-463d-bced-3d2efa9a51a9","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"tryの中で複数の例外を投げうる処理を書いて、catchでまとめて対応できるので、if err != nil { ... } に比べてコードが短く見えるのが例外派の意見かなと","ts":"1626329915.154600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vLdS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7e649958-e220-46f9-9ec1-8f0fdf27035d","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"try catchの処理部分にインデントがかかるのが昔から気に食わない","ts":"1626329896.154300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ySyd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"89bf4c1a-4a77-4abe-89b4-74e74fc93cad","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"大域脱出などいらんでしょ(過激派)","ts":"1626329849.153000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6BiL/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3ba51933-b1d8-4110-8f49-a62057277132","type":"message","user":"U023Z8L90BG","text":"思ったのはGoのdeferってfinally相当なのでcatchに当たる部分が無くて、try catchに慣れている人には違和感あるのかなと。","ts":"1626329837.152600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"t1d"}]},{"client_msg_id":"427d39c8-2c62-4583-9202-8d4f021a773e","type":"message","user":"U023Z8L90BG","text":"お手軽な帯域脱出は書きたいと思ったことがあまり無いので僕はその感覚は分からなかったです（普段Java書かないからかもしれませんが）。確かに二重のtry catch finallyは面倒なので、Goのアプローチの方が好きですね。","ts":"1626329783.151200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4TS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1f4858fd-4284-4e86-9742-2b03174945f8","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"脱出するかは別として、リソース管理もなるほどと思ったりはするのと、でもtry書きたいわけではないのもそうなんだよなとは感じます(自分が書く時)","ts":"1626329084.148500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z1HQ0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a10d18a7-7cf7-4284-9d0f-8dbd0efa7b21","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"で、上の例はJava結構複雑なtry catch finally書かなきゃいいけなくて、Java書きは好まないだろうなと。","ts":"1626329045.148000","thread_ts":"1626329045.148000","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SPS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0b1506c1-55eb-4bea-a72e-4c6a27131ec6","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"Javaが念頭にあるんですが、お手軽な帯域脱出手段が欲しいのであって、try catch finallyを書きたいとはあんまおもわないんですよね。","ts":"1626329012.147000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UuTVm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"218fff15-fa4b-4b16-be86-2f31c45673c2","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"僕は逆かなと思います。","ts":"1626328943.145800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R2gb5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5138ec1c-3a26-4906-baee-887ce8ad4962","type":"message","user":"U023Z8L90BG","text":"雑にって書き方は良く無かったかもしれない。エラー時のリソース管理の手軽な仕組みみたいなのが欲しかったということなのかなと。","ts":"1626328587.145400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Uj8GT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4a255e7f-5268-4b27-b4cf-1a42382a8b06","type":"message","user":"U023Z8L90BG","text":"goに例外が無いって言ってる人達、こういうことがやりたかったのかなって見てて思いました。\n雑にtry〜catch〜finallyで囲むような処理の代替。","ts":"1626328093.143500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zRp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f726abdd-55a8-4b3f-ba90-958a13a6c676","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"終了時に、失敗してたら出力ファイルを消し、成功してたら入力ファイルを消すようにするのにdefer使ってる。","ts":"1626328017.142500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"r6uW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b3529492-074a-4628-8454-43247e958bf9","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"昨日の名前付き戻り値とdeferで包括的に戻り値にアクセスするやつ使って、ファイルのgunzip (not keep original) +dryrun機能付き、書いてみた。","ts":"1626327696.141000","files":[{"id":"F027XUNS9PG","created":1626327696,"ti